# OpenConsult: the keys of the cloud services, for a developer running
# from source (spec 7.3, rule 3). A doctor needs no file: the connect
# screens in Settings test a key and keep it in the system's secure
# store. The app reads the store first, then the environment, then this
# file, copied to .env in the data folder; the bench reads the file in
# its key folder alone. Never commit a real value.
# The app's two services (15.13, run 9b): the language model and the
# transcription.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
SPEECHMATICS_API_KEY=
# The bench's alone: the second speech service (15.9) and the other
# language model service of its cloud kinds (15.13, run 9a2).
ASSEMBLYAI_API_KEY=
DEEPINFRA_API_KEY=
